{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Gnome (forest)\n\nYour friendship with animals mystically deepens. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You gain proficiency in the Animal Handling skill. If you\u0027re already proficient in it, your proficiency bonus is doubled for any check you make with it.\n\n- You learn the Speak with Animals spell and can cast it at will, without expending a spell slot.\n\nYou also learn the Animal Friendship spell, and you can cast it once with this feat, without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to cast it in this way when you finish a long rest. You can also cast this spell using spell slots you have of the appropriate level. Target\u0027s of the spell have disadvantage on saving throws against it.\n\nThe spells\u0027 spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.","level":1}],"id":"Custom25c9e444-45b4-4d87-a95e-edddd126a16f","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Critter Friend [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}